## 1. Fixture body

  Path: ooda/fixtures/wasm_if_false.oo
  After the Academy header, main is only:

    pub fn main() {
        if false {
            println("then-no");
        } else {
            println("else-yes");
        }
    }

  Body quote: if false { println("then-no"); } else { println("else-yes"); }
  No other statements. No imports. One public main.

## 2. Smoke drive

  Path: ooda/scripts/wasm_if_false_smoke.oo
  Binary: let oodac = "./oodac/oodac";
  Command: oodac emit-wasm fixtures/wasm_if_false.oo
  Drives product oodac: yes
  Does not name oodac/oodac.wasm4.
  Does not copy bin/ooda onto oodac/oodac.

## 3. Magic and print lock

  First eight bytes must match hex 0061736d01000000 (\0asm version 1).
  File must not contain WAT text (module.
  wasmtime is required. Home path first, then PATH. No wasmtime fails.
  When wasmtime runs:
    stdout must contain else-yes
    stdout must not contain then-no

